  revisitTitle: The stage reacts
  portrait: {fileID: -8592814519688813882, guid: e4ce0c89601e9a34497855d51bc2812f, type: 3}
  pages:
  - The crowd's heating up. The stage reacts as the song's hype climbs. Keep it going
    for bigger moments.
  highlightKey: 
  mechanicText: <link=stage>Stage effects</link> step up each time the song's <link=hype>Hype</link>
    crosses a threshold. Each upward crossing banks a flat <link=vibe>Vibe</link>
    bonus paid to every audience member at <link=song_end>song end</link>. Higher
    stages unlock as run rewards.
